  "explanations": {
    "1": "'一起'是协同副词，表示共同做某事。",
    "2": "'先'是时间副词，表示动作的先后顺序。",
    "3": "'从'引出时间或处所的起点。",
    "4": "'里'是方位名词，表示在某个范围之内。",
    "5": "'什么'是疑问代词，用于询问事物。",
    "6": "'两'是数字，表示数量二。",
    "7": "'这些'是指示代词，指代复数事物。",
    "8": "'百'是数字，表示一百。",
    "9": "'怎么'是疑问代词，用于询问方式或看法。",
    "10": "'真'是程度副词，强调程度高，相当于'确实'。",
    "11": "'那里'是指示代词，指代较远的地方。",
    "12": "'没'是否定副词，表示否定过去或完成。",
    "13": "'能'是能愿动词，表示有能力做到。",
    "14": "'还是'是连接词，表示建议或选择。",
    "15": "'地'是结构助词，用在状语后修饰动词。"
  },
  "translation": "Last weekend, my friend and I went shopping together. We first departed from home and took the subway to the shopping mall on the east side. Inside the mall, my friend asked me what I wanted to buy. I said I wanted to buy a dictionary. The shop assistant took out two books, and I looked at these. Finally I bought one with a hundred pages, and my friend bought a piece of clothing. He put it on and asked me, 'What do you think of this piece of clothing?' I said, 'Really nice!' We were all very happy. Then we went to the bookstore on the north side; when we entered, my friend was reading. There were many people there. I often go to that store, but this time I didn't find what I wanted. My friend said, 'Don't worry, I can find it. Let's still go to that store and have a look.' He looked carefully with me for every volume, and finally we found it. That day we went home together and all felt very satisfied. On the way I asked my friend, 'How much is this dictionary?' He said, 'Ten yuan.' We also drank half a cup of coffee, and my friend also bought a cup of milk tea."
